Package: RAMpb
Title: Statistical Test and Sample Size/Power Calculation for Equivalence Test Using Absolute Deviation 
  from Repeated Measures (as commonly applied in medical comparison studies)
Version: 0.1.0
Imports: 
Description: This package implements methods for various statistical tests with sample size/power calculation in a random-effects ANOVA model,
   with application to medical comparison problem (e.g. equivalence test of pulse oximetry  systems).
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
License: GPL (>= 2)
